<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's CPI down 0.7 percent m/m in February.</title>
<headline>Morocco's CPI down 0.7 percent m/m in February.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Consumer Price Index (CPI) dropped 0.7 percent in February to 148.0 from 149.0 points in January, the Statistics Directorate said.</p>
<p>It attributed the decline mainly to food products group by minus 1.6 percent while other products remained stable or stagnated, the directorate said in its latest bulletin received on Monday.</p>
<p>The base year for the index set at 100 points is 1989.</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
